    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>The King craves treasures, and YOU are the miner tasked with finding them. Dig up the riches, and survive the dangers of the mine!</i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>MINE</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/b0c0c2f63861e5b0881fceaa032d3316.poster.avif?t=1754979172\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/b0c0c2f63861e5b0881fceaa032d3316.webm?t=1754979172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/b0c0c2f63861e5b0881fceaa032d3316.mp4?t=1754979172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig through the mine to find different kinds of ores, each worth a different amount. From simple copper to rare adamant, everything  can be sold to make money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>GEAR UP</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/78847a44e5be237a4d0ead25839588bc.poster.avif?t=1754979172\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/78847a44e5be237a4d0ead25839588bc.webm?t=1754979172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/78847a44e5be237a4d0ead25839588bc.mp4?t=1754979172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tools to become a better miner! Buy stronger equipment to dig deeper, mine faster, and uncover the rarest treasures hidden underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>OVERCOME</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/ea30dbd9d25d1d0edf23aa0924c96f2b.poster.avif?t=1754979172\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/ea30dbd9d25d1d0edf23aa0924c96f2b.webm?t=1754979172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/ea30dbd9d25d1d0edf23aa0924c96f2b.mp4?t=1754979172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of the dangers lurking in the mine! Face off against goblins, spiders, and other threats as you dig deeper. Stay alert, or risk losing your hard-earned treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>TRIBUTE</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/c5c853b448f1f4f5c6712118ccc530a5.poster.avif?t=1754979172\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/c5c853b448f1f4f5c6712118ccc530a5.webm?t=1754979172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/c5c853b448f1f4f5c6712118ccc530a5.mp4?t=1754979172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the King happy by delivering treasures to him before his patience runs out! Complete tributes to earn his favor and receive random magical items as a reward for your loyalty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>WHAT TO EXPECT</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully single-player experience: no online requirements, no microtransactions, and no planned DLCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual mining gameplay: each run lasts between 5 to 40 minutes, depending on your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated mine: every run features a new mine layout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent hub &amp; metaprogression: upgrade the Throne Room, improve your standing with the King and the Miners' Guild, and uncover ancient relics across multiple runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine 4 different types of ore, each with unique value.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple win conditions: 3 distinct ways to complete a run, each offering its own challenge and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradeable mining gear: 6 different tools to enhance your mining efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic items: 8 unique magic items that grant powerful effects.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I'm a solo developer creating this game entirely in my spare time, with no budget and a lot of passion. Every line of code, piece of art, and design decision has been a personal labor of love, built from the ground up during evenings and weekends. I hope you enjoy playing it as much as I\u2019ve enjoyed making it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>The King craves treasures, and YOU are the miner tasked with finding them. Dig up the riches, and survive the dangers of the mine!</i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>MINE</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/b0c0c2f63861e5b0881fceaa032d3316.poster.avif?t=1754979172\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/b0c0c2f63861e5b0881fceaa032d3316.webm?t=1754979172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/b0c0c2f63861e5b0881fceaa032d3316.mp4?t=1754979172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig through the mine to find different kinds of ores, each worth a different amount. From simple copper to rare adamant, everything  can be sold to make money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>GEAR UP</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/78847a44e5be237a4d0ead25839588bc.poster.avif?t=1754979172\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/78847a44e5be237a4d0ead25839588bc.webm?t=1754979172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/78847a44e5be237a4d0ead25839588bc.mp4?t=1754979172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tools to become a better miner! Buy stronger equipment to dig deeper, mine faster, and uncover the rarest treasures hidden underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>OVERCOME</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/ea30dbd9d25d1d0edf23aa0924c96f2b.poster.avif?t=1754979172\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/ea30dbd9d25d1d0edf23aa0924c96f2b.webm?t=1754979172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/ea30dbd9d25d1d0edf23aa0924c96f2b.mp4?t=1754979172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of the dangers lurking in the mine! Face off against goblins, spiders, and other threats as you dig deeper. Stay alert, or risk losing your hard-earned treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>TRIBUTE</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/c5c853b448f1f4f5c6712118ccc530a5.poster.avif?t=1754979172\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/c5c853b448f1f4f5c6712118ccc530a5.webm?t=1754979172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391190/extras/c5c853b448f1f4f5c6712118ccc530a5.mp4?t=1754979172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the King happy by delivering treasures to him before his patience runs out! Complete tributes to earn his favor and receive random magical items as a reward for your loyalty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>WHAT TO EXPECT</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully single-player experience: no online requirements, no microtransactions, and no planned DLCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual mining gameplay: each run lasts between 5 to 40 minutes, depending on your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated mine: every run features a new mine layout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent hub &amp; metaprogression: upgrade the Throne Room, improve your standing with the King and the Miners' Guild, and uncover ancient relics across multiple runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine 4 different types of ore, each with unique value.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple win conditions: 3 distinct ways to complete a run, each offering its own challenge and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradeable mining gear: 6 different tools to enhance your mining efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic items: 8 unique magic items that grant powerful effects.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I'm a solo developer creating this game entirely in my spare time, with no budget and a lot of passion. Every line of code, piece of art, and design decision has been a personal labor of love, built from the ground up during evenings and weekends. I hope you enjoy playing it as much as I\u2019ve enjoyed making it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Dig up the Adamant Core from a procedurally generated mine, extract ores, sell them for profit, upgrade your equipment, and keep the King happy by sending him tributes before he loses his temper!",
